# belt/sheaths/axe: the keys of `sheath axe` the belt map held/civil/axe.pxm (rest kick lag sit) does not draw, P2c wave 2
# WEAPONS: `drawn` (the weapon is in hand: the belt is empty) and `lie` (under the body): both draw nothing, so the
# drawn and death clips find their key on the sheath channel.
use person
body adult
role sheath axe
layer belt
anchor hip
keys sheath

view D key drawn origin 0 0
|.

view D key lie origin 0 0
|.

view U key drawn origin 0 0
|.

view U key lie origin 0 0
|.

view R key drawn origin 0 0
|.

view R key lie origin 0 0
|.

view L key drawn origin 0 0
|.

view L key lie origin 0 0
|.

